#: Game.Levels.Cosets.L09_Bijection
msgid "Left multiplication sends each element of §0 to an element of §1.\n"
"§2 is this function, with domain and target restricted to those sets.\n"
"\n"
"An element of a restricted set has a value §3 and a membership proof §4.\n"
"The pair §5 gives an element and a proof that it belongs to the subgroup.\n"
"§6 proves two such elements equal by comparing their values.\n"
"§7 applies a function §8 to both sides of an equality §9.\n"
"\n"
"Is left multiplication injective on §10? Does it reach every element of §11?\n"
"Prove that this restricted function is bijective."
msgstr ""

